# One knob off flame-nocover: strike 0 -> 5000, the release window that
# opens when the strongest rival's army value falls 5,000 below its
# recent peak. Graduated from impsearch1 (log 2026-09-03), the first
# machine search of Impossible's fortress vocabulary: the only arm
# positive in both rounds with consistent magnitude (+0.317 then +0.271
# paired margin delta at sd ~0.7-0.8) while nukes1 collapsed and every
# guns arm read negative. At a 0-win rung the margin is the only
# readable signal, so this arm's next step is a 48-pair margin
# CONFIRMATION panel, not the win bar -- nothing here is adopted, and
# the ledger's no-wins-no-adoption law stands.
name strike5000
goals extractorT1,extractorT1,extractorT1,c_tank,c_tank,c_tank,hoverTank,c_artillery
heavies heavyTank,heavyTank
max_workers 8
mass 25
reserve -1
guard_cap 0
raid 3
tech 1
lurk 0
allin 0
creep 0
hold 0
decoys 0
hp_floor 0
strike 5000
navtilt 0
medics 0
navy 0
battery 0
bunkers 0
flame 2
close 3
guns 0
nukes 0
expand 1
counter 1
cover 0
intercept 1
aa_cover 1
forward 0
scout 0
rush 0
riposte 0
kite 0
income_ladder 0
rebuild 0
hunt 0
brace 0
huntgate 0
